title: "SciComp: Cross-Platform Scientific Computing Framework"
url: "https://github.com/alawein/scicomp"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alawein/scicomp"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - scientific computing
  - quantum physics
  - quantum computing
  - machine learning
  - computational physics
  - Python
  - MATLAB
  - Mathematica
  - physics simulation
abstract: >-
  SciComp is an experimental research library for quantum mechanics,
  thermal transport, and physics-informed machine learning across Python,
  MATLAB, and Mathematica source trees. The verified support promise is
  limited to the Python core documented in the repository support matrix.
